WEBVTT

00:00:02.205 --> 00:00:02.839
Ghosts:
♪ MERRY CHRISTMAS

00:00:02.883 --> 00:00:04.145
♪ MERRY CHRISTMAS

00:00:04.188 --> 00:00:07.539
♪ RING THE HOGWART BELL

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:08.802
♪ MERRY CHRISTMAS

00:00:08.845 --> 00:00:10.630
♪ MERRY CHRISTMAS

00:00:26.341 --> 00:00:29.126
KNIGHT TO E-5.

00:00:36.656 --> 00:00:40.181
QUEEN TO E-5.

00:00:45.752 --> 00:00:47.275
THAT'S TOTALLY BARBARIC.

00:00:47.318 --> 00:00:50.104
THAT'S WIZARD'S CHESS.

00:00:50.147 --> 00:00:51.366
I SEE YOU'VE PACKED.

00:00:51.409 --> 00:00:52.889
SEE YOU HAVEN'T.

00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:54.108
CHANGE OF PLANS.

00:00:54.151 --> 00:00:56.240
MY PARENTS DECIDED
TO GO TO ROMANIA

00:00:56.284 --> 00:00:58.460
TO VISIT
MY BROTHER CHARLIE.

00:00:58.503 --> 00:00:59.940
HE'S STUDYING
DRAGONS THERE.

00:00:59.983 --> 00:01:02.377
GOOD. YOU CAN
HELP HARRY, THEN.

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:04.031
HE'S GOING TO GO
AND LOOK IN THE LIBRARY

00:01:04.074 --> 00:01:06.294
FOR INFORMATION
ON NICHOLAS FLAMEL.

00:01:06.337 --> 00:01:10.124
WE'VE LOOKED
A HUNDRED TIMES.

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:12.561
NOT IN
THE RESTRICTED SECTION.

00:01:12.604 --> 00:01:14.432
HAPPY CHRISTMAS.

00:01:17.697 --> 00:01:20.787
I THINK WE'VE HAD
A BAD INFLUENCE ON HER.

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:24.747
Ron: HARRY, WAKE UP!

00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:26.662
COME ON,
HARRY, WAKE UP!

00:01:37.238 --> 00:01:38.761
HAPPY CHRISTMAS,
HARRY.

00:01:38.805 --> 00:01:40.720
HAPPY CHRISTMAS, RON.

00:01:40.763 --> 00:01:42.199
WHAT ARE YOU WEARING?

00:01:43.679 --> 00:01:45.812
OH. MY MUM MADE IT.

00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:47.683
LOOKS LIKE
YOU'VE GOT ONE, TOO.

00:01:47.727 --> 00:01:49.990
I'VE GOT PRESENTS?

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:51.208
YEAH.

00:01:58.172 --> 00:02:00.000
THERE THEY ARE.

00:02:11.663 --> 00:02:13.578
"YOUR FATHER LEFT THIS
IN MY POSSESSION

00:02:13.622 --> 00:02:15.058
"BEFORE HE DIED.

00:02:15.102 --> 00:02:17.452
"IT IS TIME IT WAS
RETURNED TO YOU.

00:02:17.495 --> 00:02:19.541
USE IT WELL."

00:02:36.079 --> 00:02:37.602
WHAT IS IT?

00:02:37.646 --> 00:02:40.127
SOME KIND OF CLOAK.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:42.129
WELL, LET'S SEE, THEN.
PUT IT ON.

00:02:45.132 --> 00:02:47.612
[GASPS] WHOA!

00:02:48.831 --> 00:02:50.093
MY BODY'S GONE!

00:02:50.137 --> 00:02:51.703
I KNOW WHAT THAT IS.

00:02:51.747 --> 00:02:53.880
THAT'S AN
INVISIBILITY CLOAK.

00:02:53.923 --> 00:02:56.273
I'M INVISIBLE?

00:02:56.317 --> 00:02:58.232
THEY'RE REALLY RARE.

00:02:59.929 --> 00:03:01.278
WONDER WHO GAVE IT TO YOU.

00:03:01.322 --> 00:03:02.627
THERE WAS NO NAME.

00:03:02.671 --> 00:03:06.501
IT JUST SAID...
"USE IT WELL."

00:03:26.347 --> 00:03:28.349
[CREAKING]

00:03:34.007 --> 00:03:36.531
"FAMOUS FIRE-EATERS."

00:03:36.574 --> 00:03:39.534
"15th-CENTURY FIENDS."

00:03:39.577 --> 00:03:41.710
FLAMEL.

00:03:41.753 --> 00:03:43.843
NICHOLAS FLAMEL.

00:03:43.886 --> 00:03:45.279
WHERE ARE YOU?

00:03:59.771 --> 00:04:01.991
AAH!

00:04:04.385 --> 00:04:06.300
Filch: WHO'S THERE?

00:04:13.394 --> 00:04:15.178
Filch:
I KNOW YOU'RE IN THERE.

00:04:15.222 --> 00:04:18.007
YOU CAN'T HIDE.

00:04:26.015 --> 00:04:27.495
WHO IS IT?

00:04:27.538 --> 00:04:29.149
SHOW YOURSELF.

00:04:57.699 --> 00:05:00.441
[CAT MEOWING]

00:05:16.892 --> 00:05:18.589
Quirrell:
SEVERUS, I THOUGHT...

00:05:18.633 --> 00:05:22.550
YOU DON'T WANT ME
AS YOUR ENEMY, QUIRRELL.

00:05:24.204 --> 00:05:25.422
WH-WHAT DO Y-YOU MEAN?

00:05:25.466 --> 00:05:26.684
YOU KNOW PERFECTLY WELL
WHAT I MEAN.

00:05:44.528 --> 00:05:47.227
WE'LL HAVE ANOTHER
LITTLE CHAT SOON,

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:49.620
WHEN YOU'VE
HAD TIME TO DECIDE

00:05:49.664 --> 00:05:53.450
WHERE YOUR
LOYALTIES LIE.

00:05:53.494 --> 00:05:55.104
OH. PROFESSORS,

00:05:55.148 --> 00:05:58.978
I FOUND THIS IN
THE RESTRICTED SECTION.

00:05:59.021 --> 00:06:01.110
IT'S STILL HOT.

00:06:01.154 --> 00:06:03.504
THAT MEANS THERE'S
A STUDENT OUT OF BED.

00:07:35.857 --> 00:07:37.163
MUM?

00:07:41.384 --> 00:07:42.498
DAD?

